  "description": "Blazor UI for StingrayDbMasking (connections, tables/columns, mask functions, database users, scripts, apply/remove, preview, audit). The pages render inside the host application's own layout and theme, in any render mode: Interactive Server, WebAssembly or static server rendering.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
